0 // Source: 3+钢琴 course slides, build pages 1-8.
0 // Draft policy: DUPLO-only approximation for manual Studio repair before MPD/course generation.
0 // Uses only project-supported DUPLO parts: 51262.dat, 4196.dat, 3011.dat, 3437.dat, 40666.dat.
0 // Known simplifications: keyboard keys use DUPLO 2x2/2x4 blocks; sloped lid is approximate.
0 // Coordinates: +Y down; ordinary plates/bricks use top-centered DUPLO origins.

